{"speciesId":326,"names":{"fr":"Groret","es":"Grumpig","en":"Grumpig","ja":"ブーピッグ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GRUMPIG uses the black pearls on its body to amplify its psychic power waves for gaining total control over its foe. When this POKéMON uses its special power, its snorting breath grows labored."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GRUMPIG uses the black pearls on its body to wield its fantastic powers. When it is doing so, it dances bizarrely. This POKéMON’s black pearls are valuable as works of art."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It stores power in the black pearls on its forehead. When it uses psychic power, it performs an odd dance step. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It can gain control over foes by doing odd dance steps. The black pearls on its forehead are precious gems."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It can gain control over foes by doing odd dance steps. The black pearls on its forehead are precious gems."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can perform odd dance steps to influence foes. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It can perform odd dance steps to influence foes. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les perles noires amplifient ses pouvoirs psy. Sa danse étrange lui permet de contrôler ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les perles noires amplifient ses pouvoirs psy. Sa danse étrange lui permet de contrôler ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes’ minds."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes’ minds."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les perles noires amplifient ses pouvoirs psychiques, lui permettant de contrôler ses ennemis avec sa danse étrange."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las perlas negras aumentan sus poderes psíquicos. Controla las mentes de sus rivales con un extraño baile."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes’ minds."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"黒真珠で サイコパワーを 強め 奇妙な ステップで 相手の 心を 操るぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les perles noires amplifient ses pouvoirs psy. Sa danse étrange lui permet de contrôler ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Usa perlas negras para potenciar sus poderes psíquicos. Con su raro baile controla a los rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"黒真珠で サイコパワーを 増幅させる。不思議な ステップで 相手の 心を 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Groret utilise les perles noires situées sur son corps pour amplifier la puissance de ses ondes psychiques et prendre le contrôle de son ennemi. Quand il utilise son pouvoir spécial, ce Pokémon a du mal à respirer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grumpig usa las perlas negras que tiene para amplificar las ondas de su poder psíquico y controlar del todo al rival. Cuando usa su poder especial, le cuesta respirar y resopla con pesadez."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grumpig uses the black pearls on its body to amplify its psychic power waves for gaining total control over its foe. When this Pokémon uses its special power, its snorting breath grows labored."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"サイコパワーの 波動を 黒真珠で 強め 自由自在に 相手を 操る ポケモン。 力を 使うとき 鼻息が 荒くなるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Groret utilise les perles noires sur son corps pour exercer ses formidables pouvoirs. Quand il est en action, il entame une étrange danse. Les perles noires de ce Pokémon ont une valeur inestimable."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Grumpig utiliza las perlas negras que tiene para usar fantásticos poderes mientras baila de forma muy extraña. Las perlas de este Pokémon están consideradas como valiosas obras de arte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Grumpig uses the black pearls on its body to wield its fantastic powers. When it is doing so, it dances bizarrely. This Pokémon’s black pearls are valuable as works of art."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"黒真珠を 利用して 不思議な 力を 使うとき 奇妙な ステップで 踊りだす。 黒真珠は 美術品の 価値を 持つ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":326,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","le